            {
              "content": "=Generate 2 engaging content topic ideas for the {{ $('Workflow Configuration').first().json.niche }} niche. For each topic, include: 1) A compelling title, 2) A brief description of the content angle, 3) A suggested posting date for the upcoming week (starting from next Monday), 4) A content category (Educational, Inspirational, Behind-the-scenes, Product-focused, Industry-news, etc.). Target audience: {{ $('Workflow Configuration').first().json.targetAudience }}. Brand voice: {{ $('Workflow Configuration').first().json.brandVoice }}. Return as a JSON array with objects containing: title, description, suggestedDate, category."
