    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ How to Setup\n\n1. OpenAI API Configuration: Add your OpenAI API credentials to both AI nodes (Generate Content Topics and Create Platform-Specific Content)\n\n2. Workflow Configuration: Update the placeholder values:\n\n        * Replace \"YOUR_CONTENT_NICHE\" with your specific niche (e.g., \"fitness\", \"marketing\", \"cooking\")\n        * Replace \"YOUR_BRAND_VOICE\" with your brand tone (e.g., \"professional and friendly\", \"casual and humorous\")\n        * Replace \"YOUR_TARGET_AUDIENCE\" with your audience description (e.g., \"small business owners\", \"fitness enthusiasts\")\n\n3. Airtable Configuration:\n\n        * Connect your Airtable account credentials\n        * Select your target base and table\n        * Ensure your Airtable has columns: Date, Platform, Title, Post Content, Hashtags, Status, Category, Image URL\n\n## ℹ️ How to Use\n\nClick the \"Test workflow\" button on the Manual Trigger node to generate a complete batch of social media content. The workflow will create 5-7 content topics, generate platform-specific versions for LinkedIn, Twitter, and Instagram, create accompanying images, and save everything to your Airtable as draft posts ready for review and scheduling.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 608,
        "color": 5
      },
